What:           /sys/bus/platform/devices/*/sms_events
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Description:
                Read-only notification snapshot for SMS storage arrivals on
                the Unisoc SIPC AT channel. Each line contains:

                <sequence> <SIM index> <memory> <storage index>

                SIM indices are zero-based (0 or 1), independently of the
                selected data SIM. Sequence numbers start at one when the
                driver is loaded. The latest 64 notifications are retained;
                reading does not consume them. poll(POLLPRI) wakes when a new
                notification is added. Consumers should rescan both cards if
                the sequence resets or a gap exceeds the retained snapshot.

                This attribute does not contain phone numbers or SMS text.
                Consumers read the indicated storage through the current AT
                channel owner, using an explicitly card-addressed command.
